 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・品種: はびこることがあると明記（Walters も広がりやすいとする）。剪定は不要だが花がら摘みで花期が延び、晩夏に刈り込むと返り咲く",
  "management_type_quote": "Can be an aggressive spreader.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/品種] Performs best in cool summer climates, and can appear rather scraggly with poor flowering in the hot and humid summer conditions of the deep South.\n[Walters/品種] Tolerates heat and humidity, but prefers a moist site.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 欧米の文献だけの蒸れ耐性：言い回しの照合では 強、文を読み直して 中（[MBG・品種] scraggly ... in the hot and humid summer conditions; stems tend to sprawl and mat ... in hot and humid climates）\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 3／MBG・品種] Can be an aggressive spreader（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 3／MBG・品種] spread ... by rhizomes and self-seeding ... to the point of being considered aggressive（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・品種] Prompt deadheading of spent flower stalks can be tedious for a large planting, but does tend to encourage additional bloom and prevent any unwanted self-seeding.\n[地下茎 3／MBG・品種] Can be an aggressive spreader.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] こぼれ種：言い回しの照合では 1、文を読み直して 3（[MBG・品種] spread ... by rhizomes and self-seeding ... to the point of being considered aggressive）\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[MBG・品種] It is a rhizomatous perennial which typically grows in dense, bushy clumps to 1-2' tall.",
  "sources_with_cultivar_page": "RHS、stauden.de、MBG、Walters",
  "sources_used": "Jelitto、MBG、RHS、Walters、stauden.de"
